OL,3,GNEWSAMilitary pays out #2.5m to abuse
OL,4,Avictims of former air cadet leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) has paid
OL,7,F#2.5m in compensation to former air
OL,8,Fcadets who were sexually abused by
OL,9,Ftheir group leader, according to a
OL,10,Flegal firm.
OL,12,FRonald Hardman, 81, an ex-officer with
OL,13,F327 Kilmarnock Squadron Air Training
OL,14,FCorps in Ayrshire, is behind bars for
OL,15,Fattacks on young boys from the 1960s to
OL,16,Fthe 1990s.
OL,18,FDigby Brown Solicitors said it had
OL,19,Frecovered the money for seven of
OL,20,FHardman's victims after he used his
OL,21,Fposition to "target, groom and attack".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
