OL,3,GNEWSAMilitary pays out #2.5m to abuse
OL,4,Avictims of former air cadet leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2018 he was sentenced to five years
OL,7,Ffor abusing three boys, nine years in
OL,8,F2019 for attacks on 12 others, then
OL,9,Feight years in 2025 for abusing two
OL,10,Fmore boys.
